044300 001-BEGIN SECTION.
044400
044500 005-SELECT-FILE.
           MOVE "C" TO MCXCBLERR-SCOPE.
           CALL "MCXCBLERR" USING MCXCBLERR-SCOPE.

044600*******************************************************
044700**   CALL 'CBLOWSRT' FIRST BEFORE GOING INTO THE
044800**   SORT VERB.  THE FIRST CALL TO 'CBLOWSRT' OPENS
044900**   UP A NEW TEMPORARY FILE 'BLUPDATA' THAT IS USED
045000**   TO WRITE THE BLOWUP INFORMATION IF A BLOWUP
045100**   OCCURS
045200*******************************************************
045300
045400     CALL "CBLOWSRT" USING CBLOWSRT-PARMS,
045500                           ACCTG-BASE,
045600                           BU-PGM-NAME,
045700                           STATUS-AREA,
045800                           DUMMY-VIEW-AREA,
045900                           FILE-STATUS,
046000                           BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
046100                           BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.
046200
046300     PERFORM 010-MAINLINE
046400         UNTIL FILE-GENERATION = 1.

046500     GOBACK.
046600
046700 010-MAINLINE.
046800
           PERFORM 9999-OPEN-STUFF.
046900     MOVE ZEROS                   TO  TRANS-FILE-RCD-COUNT.

047000     IF FIRST-PASS = 1
047100         PERFORM 020-GET-LAST-FILE
047200     ELSE
047300         PERFORM 025-GET-NEXT-FILE.

047400     SORT SORT-FILE ON ASCENDING KEY SORT-MANIFEST
047500                                     SORT-REGISTER
047600         INPUT PROCEDURE IS 050-PROCESS-TRANS
047700         OUTPUT PROCEDURE IS 700-CREATE-REPORT.

047800     PERFORM 1000-CLOSE-FILES.
047900
048100 020-GET-LAST-FILE.
      ******************************************************
      *****  02APR90 - MOVED ALL DB FILE OPENS TO 010-MAINLINE
      ******************************************************
048200*****CALL "DBOPEN" USING ACCTG-BASE
048300*****                    ACCTG-PASSWORD
048400*****                    MODE1
048500*****                    STATUS-AREA.
048600*****IF GOOD-CALL
048700*****    NEXT SENTENCE
048800*****ELSE
048900*****    MOVE "DBOPEN CSACCT * 020-GLF " TO
049000*****          BU-DISPLAY-MSG
049100*****    PERFORM 990-BLOWUP.
      ******************************************************
049200
049300     MOVE "N"                     TO  FILE-FOUND-SW.
049400     PERFORM 021-CHECK-FILES
049500         VARYING FILE-GENERATION FROM 1 BY 1
049600             UNTIL FILE-GENERATION > 10  OR
049700                   FILE-FOUND-SW = "Y".
049800
049900     DISPLAY "FILE GENERATION= ", FILE-GENERATION.
050000     DISPLAY "FILE FOUND SW = ", FILE-FOUND-SW.
050100
050200     IF FILE-FOUND-SW = "N"
