051200         MOVE MACCT-MNFST-SEQ   TO  BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
051300         PERFORM 990-BLOWUP.
051400
051500     SUBTRACT 1                   FROM FILE-GENERATION.
051600
051700     DISPLAY "DSTACT-SEQUENCE = " FILE-ID-NO-0.
051800     DISPLAY "MACCT-MNFST-SEQ = " MACCT-MNFST-SEQ.
051900
052000 021-CHECK-FILES.
052100     MOVE FILE-GENERATION         TO  DSTACT-FILE-GEN.
      *----- 04APR90 REPLACED THE FOLLOWING 2 STMTS WITH A
      *----- MACHINE DEPENDENT PERFORMED ROUTINE
052200*****MOVE FILE-COMMAND            TO  COMMAND.    04APR90
052300*****PERFORM 040-CALL-INTRINSIC.                  04APR90
           PERFORM 9999-OVERRIDE-FILE.
052400     OPEN INPUT MNFST-FILE.
052500     PERFORM 575-READ-MNSTFILE.
052600     PERFORM 525-GET-MACCT-SEQ.
      *----- UNLOCK THE MACCOUNT-INFO RECORD USING A RESET
           PERFORM 9999-RESET-MACCOUNT-INFO-IK-O.
052700
052800     IF FILE-ID-NO-0  =  MACCT-MNFST-SEQ
052900         MOVE "Y"                 TO  FILE-FOUND-SW
053000     ELSE
053100         CLOSE MNFST-FILE.
053200
053300 025-GET-NEXT-FILE.
053400     SUBTRACT 1                 FROM  FILE-GENERATION.
053500     MOVE FILE-GENERATION         TO  DSTACT-FILE-GEN.
      *----- 04APR90 REPLACED THE FOLLOWING 2 STMTS WITH A
      *----- MACHINE DEPENDENT PERFORMED ROUTINE
