105200         COMPUTE MULT-QTY = HOLD-QTY * -1.
105300     COMPUTE REC-UNIT-COST ROUNDED = TRANS-VALUE / TRANS-QTY.
105400     IF TRANS-CLASS = 206
105500         NEXT SENTENCE
105600     ELSE
