108200
108400************************************************************
108500**                                                        **
108600**   CALLED ON A CREDIT INVOICE WHERE THE RECEIPT QTY     **
108700**   IS PARTIALLY CLOSED (TRANS-QTY > TRANS-BALANCE-QTY)  **
108800**   AND THEREFORE CAN BE OPENED BACK UP BECAUSE OF THE   **
108900**   CREDIT.                                              **
