109400         MOVE ZERO                    TO  HOLD-INV-BALANCE
109500         COMPUTE TRANS-BALANCE-QTY = TRANS-BALANCE-QTY +
109600             (HOLD-QTY * -1)
109700         COMPUTE MULT-QTY = HOLD-QTY * -1
109800     ELSE
109900         COMPUTE HOLD-INV-BALANCE = HOLD-QTY +
110000                 (TRANS-QTY - TRANS-BALANCE-QTY)
110100         COMPUTE MULT-QTY = TRANS-QTY  -  TRANS-BALANCE-QTY
110200         MOVE TRANS-QTY           TO  TRANS-BALANCE-QTY.
